### Users - Create

POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "senha": "{{senha}}",
  "cpf": "{{cpf}}",
  "telefone": "{{telefone}}",
  "idade": {{idade}},
  "termos_contrato": true,
  "status_ativo": true,
  "interno_adm": false
}
